WHAT THIS COVERS

  release/d3_saudi_buildings.gpkg   building footprint polygons and tile records
  release/masks/                    binary masks rasterized from those polygons
  release/splits.csv                train/validation/test assignment
  release/tile_index.csv.gz         D4 tile identifiers and positive fractions
  release/d4_coverage.gpkg          D4 spatial extent
  release/per_tile_counts.npz       per-tile evaluation counts

These are original work: annotations produced for this study, and artifacts
derived from them.

WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER

  The tile identifiers (x18, y18, quadkey) locate the tiles these annotations
  describe. Obtaining the corresponding imagery, and complying with the terms
  of whichever provider supplies it, is the user's responsibility.

  The CrowdAI Mapping Challenge and Inria Aerial Image Labeling datasets are
  covered by their own licenses.

